<div class="tsp-pro"><div class="act-dark">
<section class="bento-sec" id="overview">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>旗艦效能款，一次看懂。</h2>
      <div class="bento">
        <div class="b b-wide b-bell">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>全球首創・防爆警鈴</h3><p class="b-sub">異常，它會先開口</p></div>
          <div class="b-fig">
            <div class="rings" aria-hidden="true"><i class="i1"></i><i class="i2"></i><i class="i3"></i>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3c-3.3 0-6 2.7-6 6v4l-1.7 3.4c-.3.7.1 1.6.9 1.6h13.6c.8 0 1.2-.9.9-1.6L18 13V9c0-3.3-2.7-6-6-6z"/><path d="M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b b-narrow b-25w">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>無線快充</h3><p class="b-sub">磁吸貼上就充，10 分鐘極速補電</p></div>
          <div class="b-fig"><span class="big">25W</span><span class="qi">WPC Qi2.2 官方認證</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="b b-half">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>10,000mAh 準固態電芯</h3><p class="b-sub">摔過、敲過、被汽車輾過，不熱失控</p></div>
          <div class="b-ph" style="border:none;padding:0;margin:22px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px"><img src="{{ 'tsp-embed-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="內部拆解結構" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="b b-half">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>TFT 智慧螢幕</h3><p class="b-sub">電量、溫度、功率，一眼掌控</p></div>
          <div class="b-fig"><div class="crop"><img src="{{ 'tsp-embed-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="TFT 智慧螢幕特寫：溫度、電量與輸出功率"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="b b-half">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>N52 磁吸＋隱藏式支架</h3><p class="b-sub">啪一聲就位，追劇不用手扶</p></div>
          <div class="b-ph" style="border:none;padding:0;margin:22px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px"><img src="{{ 'tsp-embed-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="隱藏式支架橫放" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="b b-half b-guard">
          <div class="b-head"><h3>六大防護＋NTC 控溫</h3><p class="b-sub">一顆晶片全程盯著</p></div>
          <div class="b-fig">
            <div class="tags"><span>過壓</span><span>過熱</span><span>過載</span><span>過充</span><span>短路</span><span>FOD 異物偵測</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></div>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "TSP bento", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
